WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.960
NVIDIA will invest $3 billion in meta to scale muse agents. This is MAG 7 Daily, episode 35. After that,

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:13.820
a voluntary exit at Microsoft, a thinner ipad mini, a short run of smaller items, then the

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:19.300
case against the check and a crowded funding shelf. Meta plans to put more Vera Rubin systems

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:26.460
and Vera CPUs under muse, and to add Spectrum X Ethernet plus Bluefield 4. NVIDIA's newsroom

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:31.600
says the two companies will push Muse and the wider Muse family for faster training and inference,

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:37.640
and for a lower cost of running them. They are also looking at Open Shell for safer agent deployment

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:43.700
and at Century to watch how agents behave. Jensen Huang called agents a new kind of computing

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:47.780
and said the point is infrastructure that lets Muse serve billions of people.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:52.940
Mark Zuckerberg said Muse is how meta brings personal superintelligence to everyone.

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:58.800
And Vidya says those models, on its hardware, have already posted frontier benchmark scores

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:01.260
and a surge in consumer downloads since launch.

00:01:01.780 --> 00:01:06.540
The $3 billion is a planned commitment into the share sale, not a check that has cleared.

00:01:07.574 --> 00:01:13.254
Microsoft, in a memo from Chief People Officer Amy Coleman, opened a voluntary exit for people

00:01:13.254 --> 00:01:16.214
at level 70 and below on teams that opt in.

00:01:16.834 --> 00:01:20.594
Instant gaming news put the eligible pool at about $60,000.

00:01:20.594 --> 00:01:26.474
In Canada, India, the United Kingdom and the United States, roughly a quarter of the company.

00:01:26.994 --> 00:01:31.974
Coleman framed it as support for people who already want to leave, and as a way for participating

00:01:31.974 --> 00:01:32.954
groups to resize.

00:01:33.734 --> 00:01:38.614
Not every organization is offering it, and she tied it to a voluntary program from earlier

00:01:38.614 --> 00:01:39.214
this year.

00:01:39.874 --> 00:01:42.214
Eligible staff were due in email with the terms.

00:01:42.974 --> 00:01:49.934
HDFC Sky, citing PTI, says Microsoft has about 23,000 people in India, without account

00:01:49.934 --> 00:01:55.634
of who qualifies, and that the India decision date is December 1st. The package is understood

00:01:55.634 --> 00:02:01.294
to match ordinary severance, one month of base pay for each completed year, plus health cover

00:02:01.294 --> 00:02:07.534
and career transition help. A Microsoft spokesperson said India commitments totaled $20.5 billion

00:02:07.534 --> 00:02:14.414
from 2025 through 2029, and that the company is on track to train 20 million people there in AI

00:02:14.414 --> 00:02:20.763
skills by 2030. Apple unveiled the iPad Mini that had been talked about as an OLED rumor

00:02:21.143 --> 00:02:26.923
and called this the biggest update the Mini has had. The Hindu says the body is 5.4mm

00:02:26.923 --> 00:02:34.843
thin, with an 8.5-inch OLED panel, 1200 nits at peak, 600 nits fullscreen, a 1-knit floor

00:02:34.843 --> 00:02:41.863
and contrast of 2 million to 1. It runs the A20 Pro with a 7-core GPU and a neural accelerator

00:02:41.863 --> 00:02:43.143
in each graphics core.

00:02:43.823 --> 00:02:50.423
IOL put the CPU at up to 60% faster than the last mini, the GPU at about 2.7 times,

00:02:50.963 --> 00:02:57.543
and memory bandwidth at double, with the 512GB model adding a CPU core and a second 16 core

00:02:57.543 --> 00:02:58.263
neural engine.

00:02:58.823 --> 00:03:04.963
It is IP67, good for a meter of water for 30 minutes, with 12 megapixel cameras front

00:03:04.963 --> 00:03:10.463
and back, smart HDR4, and 4,000 video at up to 60 frames a second.

00:03:10.463 --> 00:03:19.163
storage steps are 128, 256, and 512 gigabytes in midnight and starlight. The US price starts

00:03:19.163 --> 00:03:28.683
at $699. In India, Wi-Fi starts at 82,900 rupees, cellular at 1.900, and education pricing

00:03:28.683 --> 00:03:36.143
at 76,900. Pre-orders open October 28th, and the tablet goes on sale November 6th. Battery

00:03:36.143 --> 00:03:41.203
Every life is listed at up to 10 hours, and a 35-watt adapter or larger is supposed to

00:03:41.203 --> 00:03:43.563
reach a 50% charge in about 30 minutes.

00:03:44.403 --> 00:03:49.423
Dave Pacula, who runs hardware engineering, called it a full iPad that still fits in the

00:03:49.423 --> 00:03:49.763
hand.

00:03:50.323 --> 00:03:53.523
Siri AI is coming in beta with iPadOS 27.

00:03:54.504 --> 00:04:01.684
Apple also shipped iOS 27.2, the first major update of iOS 27, and it puts the iPhone duo

00:04:01.684 --> 00:04:03.724
on the same release as the other iPhones.

00:04:03.724 --> 00:04:10.384
Mac rumors says Siri AI can now recall earlier chats and pull-in photos from messages, calendar

00:04:10.384 --> 00:04:15.124
guests, and voicemails, with stronger use of Safari history and the reading list.

00:04:15.544 --> 00:04:21.304
That Siri needs an iPhone 15 Pro or newer, still does not run in the EU or mainland China,

00:04:21.824 --> 00:04:25.284
and adds French, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese, and Spanish.

00:04:25.864 --> 00:04:31.304
The same release patches more than 160 security holes, and Apple said none of them were already

00:04:31.304 --> 00:04:32.644
being used in attacks.

00:04:33.204 --> 00:04:38.084
Multiview comes to the iPhone inside the Apple TV app, up to four live sports pictures

00:04:38.084 --> 00:04:43.364
at once, for MLS, Formula One in the US, and Friday night baseball double headers.

00:04:44.024 --> 00:04:47.184
The Apple Music icon drops the red and goes black and white.

00:04:48.214 --> 00:04:51.314
Yesterday the Meta story was the spending plan hitting the market.

00:04:51.854 --> 00:04:54.814
Today the company published the share sale meant to pay for it.

00:04:54.814 --> 00:05:01.114
Telecom paper says Meta plans to sell up to $97.5 billion of stock for AI.

00:05:01.554 --> 00:05:08.254
The first piece is $37.5 billion of class A shares, plus new depository shares tied to

00:05:08.254 --> 00:05:09.054
preferred stock.

00:05:09.554 --> 00:05:14.814
The remaining $60 billion could come later by selling class C shares starting in the first

00:05:14.814 --> 00:05:16.254
quarter of 2027.

00:05:16.854 --> 00:05:21.334
The Times of India says the structure lets Mark Zuckerberg raise that money without giving

00:05:21.334 --> 00:05:26.354
up voting control, and that NVIDIA, AMD, and Broadcom want in as buyers.

00:05:27.373 --> 00:05:33.473
Jay-Z will headline Apple Music's Super Bowl 61 halftime show on February 14th, 2027,

00:05:34.033 --> 00:05:40.093
at SoFi Stadium, on ABC and ESPN in the US, and Apple Music has paid for that show since

00:05:40.093 --> 00:05:40.893
2022.

00:05:41.593 --> 00:05:49.213
Second and third generation Siri remotes now show up and find my once iOS 27.2 and TVOS 27.2

00:05:49.213 --> 00:05:49.613
are on.

00:05:49.613 --> 00:05:54.373
but they still cannot chirp and they still lack precision finding. Google says

00:05:54.373 --> 00:05:59.293
Gemini 4 Argon sits well behind Claude and GPT-6 when the task is Android

00:05:59.293 --> 00:06:04.053
coding. Zero is piping live accounting data into Google Gemini for smaller

00:06:04.053 --> 00:06:08.673
businesses. Google Classroom is gaining Gemini app publishing and a view that

00:06:08.673 --> 00:06:13.773
lets teachers read students Gemini notebook chats. Google DeepMind named ISON

00:06:13.773 --> 00:06:18.668
Gabriel, Principal Scientist and Director of the DeepMind Institute. What cuts

00:06:18.668 --> 00:06:21.368
What's against NVIDIA's $3 billion is who else is buying?

00:06:21.988 --> 00:06:24.748
The Times of India calls the pattern circular capital.

00:06:25.308 --> 00:06:30.908
Silicon suppliers are eyeing a $5 billion stake in the same AI share sale, and NVIDIA,

00:06:31.028 --> 00:06:33.568
AMD, and Broadcom are on the interested list.

00:06:34.148 --> 00:06:38.688
A supplier funding the customer that then orders that suppliers machines is not an outside

00:06:38.688 --> 00:06:40.208
vote that the demand is real.

00:06:40.768 --> 00:06:45.568
The Times also framed Zuckerberg's goal as fresh capital that does not loosen his votes.

00:06:45.568 --> 00:06:50.948
Almost a quarter of a trillion dollars is the pile the information put on three Monday

00:06:50.948 --> 00:06:54.328
fund raisings, from Anthropic, SpaceX, and Meta.

00:06:54.748 --> 00:06:57.988
And the shelf they are crowding also has Alphabet's name on it.

00:06:58.448 --> 00:07:03.028
Reuters has previously said Anthropics offering could seek as much as $100 billion.

00:07:03.888 --> 00:07:10.528
SpaceX signed a $40 billion deal with an Apollo-managed entity to lease graphics processors and called

00:07:10.528 --> 00:07:12.988
it the largest GPU financing on record.

00:07:12.988 --> 00:07:18.228
Alix Iconstein reported that the money is expected to sit in a special purpose vehicle

00:07:18.228 --> 00:07:22.288
off SpaceX's balance sheet, which could soften any rating impact.

00:07:22.788 --> 00:07:26.908
Meta's board committee wrote last week that timing mattered because the company wanted

00:07:26.908 --> 00:07:32.168
capital before rivals filled the same funding options, and it listed Alphabet, SpaceX,

00:07:32.588 --> 00:07:34.668
Anthropic, and OpenAI in that queue.

00:07:35.268 --> 00:07:40.168
Microsoft is the other of these seven in that piece, and the fresh figure is how many people

00:07:40.168 --> 00:07:40.948
actually leave.

00:07:40.948 --> 00:07:48.468
The global headcount is 223,000, an earlier exit offer went to 9,000 people, and about a third

00:07:48.468 --> 00:07:54.648
took it. This round is expected to draw a smaller share under 20,000. The bind is the funding

00:07:54.648 --> 00:08:00.728
shelf, not a product the company share. Metas directors treated Alphabet's deals as taking space on

00:08:00.728 --> 00:08:06.368
the same equity and debt menus. Microsoft is offering exits while that window is still described as

00:08:06.368 --> 00:08:11.428
open. The Apollo lease is the article's picture of a Musk company choosing an off-balance

00:08:11.428 --> 00:08:16.668
sheet GPU rental instead of a straight loan. Musk, in a post, the information quotes,

00:08:17.048 --> 00:08:21.328
said debt markets have lately shut to firms whose only revenue is AI data centers,

00:08:21.788 --> 00:08:26.308
and that more than 200 neoclouds face what he called guppy-level death and consolidation.

00:08:27.068 --> 00:08:32.668
The information calls that self-serving. Fewer neoclouds could leave more capital for the big names

00:08:32.668 --> 00:08:38.268
later. Apollo's chief economist, Torsten Slok, wrote over the weekend that outside tech,

00:08:38.808 --> 00:08:43.468
corporate America has seen zero financial payoff from the technology, whatever the spend

00:08:43.468 --> 00:08:48.188
and the noise. For meta, the filing makes the raise a race against other calendars,

00:08:48.428 --> 00:08:53.628
alphabets included. For alphabet, being named in that pipeline is the jam meta says it is

00:08:53.628 --> 00:08:59.408
trying to beat, and the piece never gives alphabets own check. For Microsoft, expected take-up

00:08:59.408 --> 00:09:05.208
means the offer does not empty a quarter of a 223-person company. The open risk is

00:09:05.208 --> 00:09:10.628
slox zero, and Musk's line that dislike could spread from neo-clouds to larger AI firms

00:09:10.628 --> 00:09:15.948
if customers still see no return. The article dates neither the anthropic offerings closed

00:09:15.948 --> 00:09:22.526
nor the Apollo vehicle. Eligible Microsoft people in India have until December 1st to take the exit.

00:09:23.166 --> 00:09:29.066
Meta's class C-sale, as much as $60 billion of the AI offering, may start in the first quarter

00:09:29.066 --> 00:09:34.946
of 2027. Before we go, the Mini is the Apple product that actually shipped this week. The

00:09:34.946 --> 00:09:40.186
Macs around it are still marked expected, not in stores. That's Mag 7 daily for today.

